`opentelemetry-instrumentation-aiokafka`, `opentelemetry-instrumentation-confluent-kafka`, `opentelemetry-instrumentation-kafka-python`: emit `messaging.kafka.cluster.id` on producer and consumer spans. `ConfluentKafkaInstrumentor.instrument_producer()` and `instrument_consumer()` accept an optional `bootstrap_servers`, which lets a manually instrumented client share one resolved cluster id with other clients on the same brokers
